l degradation of target proteins. May play a role in the regulation of cell proliferation and autophagy by promoting the ubiquitination and degradation of SQSTM1 (PubMed:34164402)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}